1	/**
2	 * Tests for poll/feature-review-cycle.ts (T4 — Feature Reviewer Daemon)
3	 *
4	 * Covers:
5	 *   1. classifyFileOverlap — no overlap returns hasOverlap: false
6	 *   2. classifyFileOverlap — overlap returns hasOverlap: true with correct files
7	 *   3. No new commits (ahead_by === 0) → emits feature_review_no_drift; skips
8	 *   4. New commits, no file overlap → calls tryAutoRebase (task-level path)
9	 *   5. Auto-rebase clean → emits feature_review_rebased; pushes
10	 *   6. Auto-rebase conflict → escalates; emits drift_escalated
11	 *   7. File overlap, no Anthropic key → escalates directly
12	 *   8. File overlap, semantic analysis: confidence ≥ threshold → auto-rebase
13	 *   9. File overlap, semantic analysis: confidence < threshold → escalate
14	 *  10. Slack set → drift_slack_sent emitted
15	 *  11. Slack absent → drift_slack_skipped emitted
16	 *  12. feature_status not in_handoff → skipped entirely
17	 *  13. drift_detected already true → skipped
